---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Returns &amp; Refunds" description="sudostore returns and refunds policy.">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <p class="font-mono text-sm text-phosphor-dim">
      <span class="text-red">~/</span>returns<span class="cursor ml-1"></span>
    </p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Returns &amp; Refunds</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-faint">Last updated: September 2026</p>

    <div class="article mt-8">
      <h2>Damaged or faulty</h2>
      <p>If something arrives damaged or develops a fault, contact us within 7 days and we'll repair, replace or refund it — your choice. Please include photos or a short description so we can resolve it fast.</p>

      <h2>Change of mind</h2>
      <p>Custom and made-to-order items (including 3D-printed work and configured/refurbished hardware) are <strong>non-refundable</strong> unless faulty — they're built specifically for you.</p>
      <p>In-stock standard items can be returned within 7 days of delivery for a refund, provided they're in original condition and packaging. Return shipping is your responsibility.</p>

      <h2>Software</h2>
      <p>Software that was pre-installed or flashed onto hardware is non-refundable once delivered, unless it doesn't work as described — in which case we'll fix it or refund it.</p>

      <h2>How refunds work</h2>
      <p>Refunds are issued within 5 working days of approval, back to the same method you paid with (typically EFT).</p>

      <h2>To start a return</h2>
      <p>Message us on WhatsApp or email with your order details and what's wrong. We'll take it from there.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>